# Command Workflows

Slash commands in `commands/` are **workflow specs** shared by Claude Code and Cursor.
When the user requests one of these workflows, read the linked file and follow it exactly.

**Daily core:** TA intakes → confluence → optional Agentic confirm (Portfolio C). Research is on demand.

| User intent | Workflow file |
|-------------|---------------|
| TradeWhisperer lists/charts (user paste) | [commands/tradewhisperer-charts.md](commands/tradewhisperer-charts.md) or skill `tradewhisperer-charts` |
| GEX/VEX exposure maps (user screenshots) | [commands/gex-vex-maps.md](commands/gex-vex-maps.md) or skill `gex-vex-maps` |
| Operator charts (your charting) | [commands/operator-charts.md](commands/operator-charts.md) or skill `operator-charts` |
| TA confluence (candle-first / map-first) | [commands/ta-confluence.md](commands/ta-confluence.md) or skill `ta-confluence` |
| Agentic co-pilot trade (Portfolio C) | [commands/agentic-copilot-trade.md](commands/agentic-copilot-trade.md) or skill `agentic-copilot-trade` |
| Options flow screener → primary tail | [commands/options-flow-tail.md](commands/options-flow-tail.md) or skill `options-flow-tail` |
| Log positions (A+C only — skip IRA) | [commands/log-positions.md](commands/log-positions.md) or skill `log-positions` |
| Log trade from screenshot | [commands/log-trade-screenshot.md](commands/log-trade-screenshot.md) or skill `log-trade-screenshot` |
| Robinhood portfolio review (A+C focus) | Skill `robinhood-portfolio-review` → `reports/portfolio/portfolio_review_*.md` |
| Intraday options plan | [commands/intraday-options.md](commands/intraday-options.md) |
| Options strategy plan for TICKER | [commands/options-strategy-planner.md](commands/options-strategy-planner.md) |
| Deep research on TICKER (optional) | [commands/deep-research.md](commands/deep-research.md) |
| Update existing research (optional) | [commands/update-research.md](commands/update-research.md) |
| Research watchlist batch (optional) | [commands/review-portfolio.md](commands/review-portfolio.md) |
| Scenario analysis | [commands/scenario-analyzer.md](commands/scenario-analyzer.md) |

**Deep research rule (when used):** Pass 0 preflight (`scripts/research_preflight.py`) reuse-first — then complete ALL Pass 1 collection before writing any report text. Partial data beats no report; note failures in one sentence and continue.

See [commands/README.md](commands/README.md) for Claude vs Cursor invocation.
